# Effigy Shoals (CIPlay effigy_shoals): The Lullaby Frequency's third island, quest "Count Them Again". The shoal at
# 1.2 m; channels on 90/210/330 degrees from 13 m out; effigies on rings of 20 and 28 m round bars on 30/150/270
# degrees (the south bar's middle ones at 0 -20 and 0 -28: walk up x 2.6); the circle at 0 0, the tallest effigy 0 6;
# the landing 0 -34, the tide marker -3 -32; the east bar's note on a crate at 22 8. DEEP 10-25: the Pyre Dune at -50 29
# (foot zone hillfoot at -31.83 18.47), the drowned boathouse at 38 66 (-14 m), the Choir's cave zone at 50 35.
island Effigy Shoals
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Count Them Again
wait 3
expect shown effin
expect hidden effout
walk 2.6 -40 to 2.6 -35
zone landing
expect step 1
read Tide marker
expect step 2
walk 2.6 -30 to 2.6 -8 to 0 -2 h=1.2
zone circle
expect hidden effin
expect shown effout
expect step 3
read Choir hymn sheet
expect story hymn 1
expect step 4
walk 4 2 to 14 6 to 20 7 h=1.2
read Who made them
expect step 5
zone hillfoot
expect step 6
zone hilltop
expect step 7
read Choir warden Hester Vane's count
expect step 8
open Pyre chest
expect story reliquarykey 1
expect step 9
zone boathouse
expect step 10
air boatair
read Boatman Silas Crewe's note
expect step 11
zone choircave
expect step 12
read Novice Lise Marren's note
open Choir's reliquary
expect done
open Choir's offering basket
